          q: 'A mixing vessel makes a plain sauce and a sauce with nuts. Switching from nut to plain needs a long validated clean; plain to nut needs only a rinse. How do you order a week?',
          options: ['Alternate the two sauces so both stocks stay level', 'Nut sauce first, plain sauce at the end of the week', 'Plain sauce first, the nut sauce in one run after it', 'The order makes no difference at all to the cleaning time'],
